147: * covers and no test can import. They are now one call to `callerFromAuthAnswer`, which the
148: * acceptance fixture drives on every validated path and
149: * `tests/at/harness/shipped-caller.selftest.ts` drives shape by shape. What is left below is I/O:
150: * one header read, one `fetch`, one body parse.
151: *
152: * THE WHOLE BODY IS HANDED OVER, NEVER A NARROWED PIECE OF IT. `callerFromAuthAnswer` reads
153: * `identities[]` to find the linked GitHub handle, so passing `{ id }` â€” or anything else this file
154: * pre-selected â€” would return a caller with `githubHandle: null` and refuse every linked volunteer
