89: *     `OPTIONS` would be answered 405 and no browser would ever reach the real call.
90: *   * NOTHING ESCAPES AS A BARE STATUS. A rejected `fetch` (Auth or the Data API unreachable) or a
91: *     non-JSON success body throws, and an exception out of a `Deno.serve` handler becomes a 500
92: *     with no body â€” precisely the case where a caller most needs to tell a refusal from an outage.
93: *     Anything thrown becomes a shaped 502 carrying a sentence, which is this file's standing
94: *     contract: the reason travels, never a bare status.
