476: * shape. So both are probed, BOTH ANSWERS GO IN THE TRANSCRIPT, and the extraction below branches on
477: * what actually replied. An assumption here would fail as "no email arrived", which is
478: * indistinguishable from the mailer being rate-limited â€” the single most misleading way this script
479: * could go wrong.
